@startuml agent_capabilities_comprehensive
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #333333
  BorderThickness 2
}

component [**Red Agent**\nMITRE ATT&CK\n295 Techniques\nFull Kill Chain] as RedAgent #FFE6E6

component [**Discovery Phase**\nNetwork scanning\nService enumeration\nTopology mapping] as Discovery #FFF2CC
component [**Reconnaissance**\nVulnerability assessment\nService identification\nTarget prioritization] as Recon #FFF2CC
component [**Initial Access**\nExploit vulnerabilities\nCredential access\nPrivilege escalation] as Access #FFF2CC
component [**Impact Phase**\nLateral movement\nData exfiltration\nSystem disruption] as Impact #FFF2CC

component [**Blue Agent**\nStrategic Defense\n2|H|+1 Actions\nPPO Learning] as BlueAgent #E6F3FF

RedAgent --> Discovery : Phase 1
Discovery --> Recon : Transition
Recon --> Access : Transition
Access --> Impact : Transition

BlueAgent --> RedAgent : Counter-strategies
BlueAgent --> Discovery : Deploy Decoys
BlueAgent --> Recon : Monitor Activity
BlueAgent --> Access : Isolate Threats
BlueAgent --> Impact : Contain Damage

note right of BlueAgent : Adaptive Defense Actions:\n• Deploy Decoy\n• Remove Decoy\n• Monitor Network\n• Strategic Isolation

@enduml
